 - 2026-10-20 M3: incident merge uses wildcard overlap (spec §7) and names the incident after the localizer primary, but only while that primary segment is itself warning -- guards against the IBM stale-primary bug (OldReference DEVIATIONS WP-11 follow-up). Network-wide verdicts (PLATFORM_WIDE, MULTI_FAULT -> platform; SWITCH_STATUS_OVERLOAD -> switch) fold all warnings into one incident so M4 builds one package, not ~8 (seen on S6 U0).
